   "text": "{\"sections\":[{\"section\":\"summary\",\"body\":\"Quillon AI was compliant with all three covenants on its Venture Term Loan for the period ended October 31, 2026. The compliance certificate agrees with the bank's calculation on each covenant. The main change is a steady narrowing of the cushion over the Minimum Unrestricted Cash covenant from August through October, now at {{fact:77a74bfd-623b-4e7e-b893-f03c58af6e7c}}. This was flagged as a low-severity signal. No work items are open and no decision is pending this period.\"},{\"section\":\"covenants\",\"body\":\"Minimum Runway was {{fact:8b6f2708-f755-4965-bc70-bef55dbc8b28}} against a required {{fact:6a6e03e8-4812-467c-ba3a-b70f28d98ba8}}, a cushion of {{fact:b4f80f03-752e-49de-a660-0307d1c115c9}}. Minimum Unrestricted Cash was {{fact:a5e2880c-3816-4814-b67a-d7a7ead1b1a7}} against a required {{fact:6c53ba62-0a59-4725-943e-393ce7da89e1}}, a cushion of {{fact:77a74bfd-623b-4e7e-b893-f03c58af6e7c}}. Revenue to Plan was {{fact:f3bbecf2-88d2-4da3-9cea-c0870f67c0d5}} against a required {{fact:35170122-0373-4cb6-97c9-658639fc29c3}}, a cushion of {{fact:9f87e2cc-7ee0-403a-b791-4a0da0114546}}. The certificate reported {{fact:3b4381d4-7102-4170-8d64-5c88d91fa2d4}}, {{fact:5c3abdeb-ac0d-43f9-aa81-37b0aa684bd6}} and {{fact:570d0990-d0ef-4f64-83ac-e52b5f762f1b}} respectively. Each matches the bank's calculation, and each covenant is compliant.\"},{\"section\":\"risks\",\"body\":\"One early warning signal fired, rated low severity: covenant headroom falling on Minimum Unrestricted Cash. The cushion narrowed in each month from August to October and now stands at {{fact:77a74bfd-623b-4e7e-b893-f03c58af6e7c}}. Cash of {{fact:a5e2880c-3816-4814-b67a-d7a7ead1b1a7}} remains above the {{fact:6c53ba62-0a59-4725-943e-393ce7da89e1}} floor. The signal attributes the trend to ongoing cash burn. The August and September cushion figures were not among the facts provided for this draft, so a reviewer may wish to confirm the month-on-month trajectory. No work items are open.\"}]}",
